WEBVTT

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:02.726
My father, who is 92, likes to say,

00:11:03.778 --> 00:11:07.347
"Let's stop talking
only about how to save the old folks

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:11.964
and start talking about
how to get them to save us all."

00:11:13.837 --> 00:11:15.277
Thank you.

00:11:15.301 --> 00:11:18.095
(Applause)